thoughtrecipe chainer_links
"Chainer `link` blocks build and run a real chain: each link reads its `from` keys, prompts the model, and writes its capture target."

trigger as capability:
  may read workspace

agent summarizer uses chainer

run summarizer:
  link first:
    from state.input_a
    prompt "Summarize input A."
    capture result -> state.out_a
  link second:
    from state.out_a
    prompt "Summarize input B."
    capture result -> state.out_b